<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">SHARE YOUR MOVEMENT</view><view class="heading">上传一段热爱</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">{{file?'重新选择视频':'＋ 选择舞蹈视频'}}</button><view class="muted">不超过 90 秒 · 最大 100MB · 服务端自动压缩</view><view wx:if="{{file}}"><view class="preview-wrap"><video id="preview" src="{{file}}" controls="{{false}}" show-center-play-btn="{{false}}" object-fit="contain"/><cover-view class="preview-label {{styleName}}">{{title||'舞动此刻'}}</cover-view></view><view class="label">封面选帧 · {{frame}} 秒</view><slider min="0" max="{{frameMax * 10}}" step="1" value="{{frame * 10}}" bindchange="frame" activeColor="#6b805a"/><view class="muted">拖动选择视频中的画面，提交后自动搭配标题颜色。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">作品标题 · 最多 8 个字</text><input class="input" value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="8" placeholder="给这段舞蹈起个名字" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">舞蹈分类</text><picker range="{{categories}}" range-key="displayName" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="category" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker">{{categoryIndex>=0?categories[categoryIndex].displayName:'请选择末级分类'}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">常用标签 · 点击自动加入</text><view class="tag-choices"><button wx:for="{{commonTags}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag-choice" data-tag="{{item}}" bindtap="addTag" disabled="{{busy}}">+ {{item}}</button></view><text class="label">标签 · 用逗号分隔，最多 8 个</text><input class="input" value="{{tags}}" data-field="tags" bindinput="input" maxlength="120" placeholder="如：舞蹈日常，零基础，古典" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">谁可以看</text><picker range="{{visibilities}}" value="{{visibilityIndex}}" bindchange="visibility" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker">{{visibilities[visibilityIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">封面艺术字</text><picker range="{{styles}}" value="{{styleIndex}}" bindchange="style" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker">{{styles[styleIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="notice">所有作品均需审核。私有视频仅在待审时向审核管理员开放。成功提交扣 1 次，失败不扣，驳回不退次。每日先使用免费次数，再使用永久额外次数。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{busy?(progress===100?'视频处理中，请稍候…':'上传中 '+progress+'%'):'提交审核 ↗'}}</button></view>

